    {
      "id": "compose-material-3",
      "name": "Compose Material 3",
      "version": "1.3.0-beta05",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/compose-material3#1.3.0-beta05",
      "detailsHtml": "<ul>\n <li>Fixed issue where <code>BottomSheet</code> content is missing or cut off on Android N and O (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/q/I0462448c8ad157e2a676cbeb46a2b56c3da10a2d\">a10a2d</a>)</li>\n <li>Increased slider’s semantics bounds in order for <code>TalkBack</code> to properly show the focus indicators around the thumbs. (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/q/I2b780abefd12f89b9586063eaaa633b2290b5a1d\">0b5a1d</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/cd4111597651ae0fbd21781f47d06fb3a214bbd6..37922ee451c7e281c262f8570e84cba4efcaec47/compose/material3"
    },
