    {
      "id": "lifecycle",
      "name": "Lifecycle",
      "version": "2.8.4",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/lifecycle#2.8.4",
      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li><code>LiveData.asFlow()</code> now correctly handles cases where the returned Flow is immediately completed after receiving a value already set on the <code>LiveData</code> (for example, when using <code>take(1)</code>). (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I9c56697c40907f9cee43f89f7ee1aa01adb470b1\">I9c566</a>)</li>\n <li><code>Lifecycle*Effect</code> completion is now idempotent (i.e., if the <code>onStopOrDispose</code> was called because of the Lifecycle being stopped, it won’t be called a second time upon disposal unless the Lifecycle goes back up to <code>STARTED</code> again). (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I5f607934fb725f98c018b567e6e2f0052c7e8a69\">I5f607</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/352364595\">b/352364595</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/92cc6e5d71efd12345ce7ba558cbc2a29926e9ac..e878847bccb7129bf31369a274059013b3a3c240/lifecycle"
    },
    {
      "id": "navigation",
      "name": "Navigation",
      "version": "2.8.0-beta06",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/navigation#2.8.0-beta06",
      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Fixed an issue where the <code>WrongStartDestinationType</code> lint checks did not check for Companion objects on the passed in class type, causing lint to fail to detect the error. (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I92b095af135ce0cffd5cd251de65a3ee70d813c8\">I92b09</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/56579bc30499ce39f0d7a6713a065b00c6194206..8b5ab34869fa8731b13a77763ea92989ce4ef70d/navigation"
    },
    {
      "id": "paging",
      "name": "Paging",
      "version": "3.3.1",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/paging#3.3.1",
      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Fixed an issue where <code>AsyncPagingDataDiffer</code> or APIs built on top of it like the <code>PagingDataAdapter</code> used with <code>RecyclerView</code> would be unable to trigger more loads when the backing data source refreshed while scrolling. (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I60ca5c23e01c2ff28d120d10ae9b28eda57fac50\">I60ca5</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/352586078\">b/352586078</a>)</li>\n <li>Fixed a crash that occurs when items are removed from the backing data source while scrolling a <code>RecyclerView</code> using a <code>PagingDataAdapter</code> or <code>AsyncPagingDataDiffer</code>. (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I8c65ac87639c0d501ccab1fd44fd3adbc9147a31\">I8c65a</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/347649763\">b/347649763</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/656d55d844d23f2561b23f4970d65e4b7f63debc..358f66daa422fdd114efe0c11683c70b47ba1051/paging"
    },
    {
      "id": "privacysandbox-sdkruntime",
      "name": "Privacysandbox Sdkruntime",
      "version": "1.0.0-alpha14",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/privacysandbox-sdkruntime#1.0.0-alpha14",
      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>New Features</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Introduce <code>SdkSandboxControllerCompat#getClientPackageName</code> for retrieving client app package name.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>API Changes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li><code>SandboxedSdkProviderAdapter</code> from sdkruntime-core completely removed. Please use <code>SandboxedSdkProviderAdapter</code> from sdkruntime-provider library.</li>\n</ul>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/638a8d3a474af45f6ad5fdc3d6d1836ea42d1778..8b5ab34869fa8731b13a77763ea92989ce4ef70d/privacysandbox/sdkruntime"
    },
    {
      "id": "transition",
      "name": "Transition",
      "version": "1.5.1",
      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/transition#1.5.1",
      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Fixed an issue where calls to <code>animateToStart()</code> or <code>animateToEnd()</code> on a seekable transition would be ignored if the transition was not started. (<a href=\"https://android-review.googlesource.com/#/q/I44d9618604c29659e1f6ae7e966cd1533369b18c\">I44d96</a>, <a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/338624457\">b/338624457</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
      "commitsUrl": "https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/support/+log/997511f658e698f2cc9bfbb485bacdefc476ba19..2d628af7c0127584d10f86a6e0872691a5de4536/transition"
    },
